WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:03.020
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:09.830
Today I am going to explain the American prison
action thriller film called “Escape Plan.”

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:11.430
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:16.990
Watch out and take care!

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:20.960
The movie starts in a high-security federal
prison in Colorado.

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:25.899
An inmate named Ray Breslin is approached
by a fellow inmate who warns him about someone

00:00:25.899 --> 00:00:27.279
named Jax.

00:00:27.279 --> 00:00:30.720
According to him, Jax is about to start a
fight with Ray.

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:36.140
The next day, like the inmate had said, Jax
attacks Ray but is soon overpowered by him.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:40.840
Ray wins the fight but because of the commotion,
the prison guards put him into the isolation

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:42.370
area of the prison.

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:46.430
It is a high-security area that only the dangerous
inmates are brought into.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:51.350
Ray is then put into a tiny room with no windows
and only a toilet.

00:00:51.350 --> 00:00:55.230
He is also watched upon at all times through
a security camera.

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:58.190
The only possession he is allowed to have
is a bible.

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:01.950
Ray quickly begins to devise a plan to escape
from the prison.

00:01:01.950 --> 00:01:06.299
He has already analyzed the layout of the
prison and found that the high-security area

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:07.950
is beside the fire garage.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:12.640
Next, he notices that the prison is short
on guards which makes his work easier.

00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:17.710
For several days, Ray watches the guards and
figures out their regular behavioral pattern

00:01:17.710 --> 00:01:21.479
includes going out to smoke for exactly seven
minutes.

00:01:21.479 --> 00:01:26.189
With these pieces of information, Ray figures
out what time and way would be the best to

00:01:26.189 --> 00:01:27.189
escape from.

00:01:27.189 --> 00:01:31.880
Now, he only has to find a way to somehow
get the passcode to his high-security prison

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:32.880
door.

00:01:32.880 --> 00:01:36.759
For this, he tears a thin layer of plastic
from the chocolate milk packaging that he

00:01:36.759 --> 00:01:38.229
is given with every meal.

00:01:38.229 --> 00:01:42.450
He sneakily lays the plastic on the touchpad
and acquires the series of numbers of the

00:01:42.450 --> 00:01:43.490
passcode.

00:01:43.490 --> 00:01:46.869
With the numbers in hand, it is easy for him
to figure out the sequence.

00:01:46.869 --> 00:01:51.869
He also manages to inform his team outside
the prison to create a distraction at exactly

00:01:51.869 --> 00:01:54.270
four on the day he will escape.

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.649
Finally, he executes the plan one day.

00:01:56.649 --> 00:02:01.279
As the guards go for a smoke break, he uses
the passcode to get out of the cell.

00:02:01.279 --> 00:02:04.880
Then, through a vent, he enters the unguarded
fire garage.

00:02:04.880 --> 00:02:09.220
At this moment, his team causes a fire outside
the prison as a distraction.

00:02:09.220 --> 00:02:13.760
The firemen take the fire brigade outside
and Ray manages to go out with them by latching

00:02:13.760 --> 00:02:16.030
himself to the bottom of the vehicle.

00:02:16.030 --> 00:02:20.250
After finally getting out of the prison, Ray
drives away with his teammates, Abigail and

00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.250
Hush.

00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.760
They leave him by the side of a telephone
booth where the police eventually find and

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:25.880
arrest him.

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:30.350
However, before they can take Ray back to
the prison, a man named Lester Clark arrives

00:02:30.350 --> 00:02:33.530
at the scene and talks to the guards to let
Ray go.

00:02:33.530 --> 00:02:37.470
In the following scene, we see Lester and
Ray talk to the prison head.

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:43.030
It is finally revealed that Ray is actually
the founder of a security firm called Breslin-Clark

00:02:43.030 --> 00:02:45.850
that tests the security measures of prisons.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:50.570
He is not a criminal but a businessman who
goes to several prisons as an inmate to check

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:51.570
if they are escape-proof.

00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:57.370
Over the years, he has garnered a reputation
as the man who can escape any prison.

00:02:57.370 --> 00:03:02.070
The prison guard is beyond surprised and thankful
for Ray’s feedback on how they can make

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.150
the prison’s security better.

00:03:04.150 --> 00:03:08.240
After the meeting, Ray goes to his office
for the first time in five months.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:12.320
He is greeted by his friends and employees,
Abigail and Hush.

00:03:12.320 --> 00:03:17.390
His business partner Lester has scheduled
a meeting with CIA operative Jessica Miller.

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:22.360
She wants Ray to test a new, top-secret prison
for disappeared persons on the condition that

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.630
Ray and his team cannot know the prison's
true location.

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:30.100
She offers him millions of dollars for the
deal but Ray is skeptical of the idea.

00:03:30.100 --> 00:03:33.500
He only agrees to go when his partner Lester
requests him.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:37.970
They provide him with a fake identity of a
Spanish terrorist-for-hire named "Anthony

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:38.970
Portos."

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:43.540
On the day he is supposed to go to the prison,
Abigail places a tracker on his arm, as per

00:03:43.540 --> 00:03:44.540
protocol.

00:03:44.540 --> 00:03:49.250
However, things start going south when he
is kidnapped and drugged to be put in prison

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:51.550
so its location remains anonymous.

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:56.670
His abductors also painfully bring out the
tracker from his arm as Ray loses consciousness.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:04:01.210
When he wakes up, Ray finds himself in a glass
cell on top of a platform.

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:04.680
Around him are several similar cells with
prisoners in them.

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:07.030
They are being watched through moving cameras.

00:04:07.030 --> 00:04:11.350
Ray is then brought to meet the prison warden
Hobbes who introduces himself.

00:04:11.350 --> 00:04:16.030
Ray is confused because he was told the prison
warden is a person named Marsh.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:20.400
Knowing something is off, Ray cites his evaluation
code which is supposed to get him out of the

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.470
prison in case of an emergency.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:26.840
However, the warden completely ignores it
and declares him an inmate.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:31.190
Outside the prison, Abigail and Hush try their
best to find Ray’s location.

00:04:31.190 --> 00:04:35.500
While back in the prison, the inmates are
told to evacuate to the “Babylon” area.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:40.060
The guards all wear identical masks and are
allowed to hit any inmate they dislike.

00:04:40.060 --> 00:04:45.330
A while later, Ray is approached by another
inmate named Emil who warns him to not get

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:46.830
killed.

00:04:46.830 --> 00:04:50.610
He also says that he hasn’t committed any
crime and was simply imprisoned because some

00:04:50.610 --> 00:04:54.889
people want to get the information about his
boss Mannheim from him.

00:04:54.889 --> 00:04:59.550
Ray now starts to believe that this prison
doesn’t hold federal criminals but is a

00:04:59.550 --> 00:05:02.980
torture chamber that rich people send their
enemies to.

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:05.900
He plans to investigate further in the isolation
area.

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:09.740
So, Ray and Emil start a fight to be sent
there.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:15.700
The warden sees this from the cameras and
is almost excited to have them fighting.

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:22.040
Soon, they are sent to the isolation area
which is a tiny room and substitute for a

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:23.210
torture chamber.

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:27.730
The room acts like an oven, with a temperature
higher than a human being can handle.

00:05:27.730 --> 00:05:32.810
It is intended to disorient and dehydrate
prisoners with high-powered halogen lights.

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:36.150
The warden watches the two suffer in the heat
through the cameras.

00:05:36.150 --> 00:05:40.980
After a day in the chamber, a prison doctor
named Dr. Kyrie visits Ray.

00:05:40.980 --> 00:05:45.870
He seems sympathetic to him but doesn’t
answer when Ray asks him their location.

00:05:45.870 --> 00:05:49.140
After the session, Emil and Ray are let out
of the room.

00:05:49.140 --> 00:05:53.860
During his time in the chamber, Ray has found
out that the cell floors have rivets of steel

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:55.780
instead of more secure aluminum.

00:05:55.780 --> 00:06:00.710
So, he asks Emil to acquire a metal plate
that he can use to open the rivets.

00:06:00.710 --> 00:06:05.250
On Emil’s next meeting with the warden,
he is asked about his boss Mannheim again.

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:09.810
Emil deliberately makes the warden mad and
guards forcefully shove a water pipe down

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:10.810
his throat.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:14.340
While he is being tortured, Emil manages to
get a piece of metal.

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:18.120
After the meeting, he demands to know Ray’s
plan in turn for the favor.

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:21.889
Ray reveals that he has been analyzing the
structure of the prison and has come to a

00:06:21.889 --> 00:06:24.370
conclusion that the place is underground.

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:29.210
So, if he gets the bolts out and makes his
way upward, he might be able to reach the

00:06:29.210 --> 00:06:30.210
surface.

00:06:30.210 --> 00:06:33.780
After hearing his plan, Emil believes that
Ray can help him escape.

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:38.860
They quickly execute the plan and start a
fight to be sent back to the isolation chamber.

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:42.889
There, Ray begins to open the rivet while
hiding from the camera.

00:06:42.889 --> 00:06:47.490
After he is done, he bangs the chamber to
signal Emil to distract the guards again.

00:06:47.490 --> 00:06:51.900
Emil starts to scream making everyone look
at him while Ray blocks his camera with a

00:06:51.900 --> 00:06:54.020
paper ball he had in his mouth.

00:06:54.020 --> 00:06:57.330
He finally gets into the vent and makes his
way outside.

00:06:57.330 --> 00:07:01.919
On his way, he accidentally breaks a pipe
making the chamber fill with water.

00:07:01.919 --> 00:07:06.790
When Ray finally gets outside, he is surprised
to see that the prison is in a massive cargo

00:07:06.790 --> 00:07:08.889
ship in the middle of the ocean.

00:07:08.889 --> 00:07:11.919
He quickly goes back in before anyone can
see him.

00:07:11.919 --> 00:07:16.570
The water leak causes the isolation chambers
to flood which distracts the guards and makes

00:07:16.570 --> 00:07:19.580
it easy for him to get back without being
caught.

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:24.830
In the following scene, we see Ray’s friends
Abigail and Hush talk to Lester about Ray’s

00:07:24.830 --> 00:07:25.830
disappearance.

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:29.490
They see that the check Ray had been provided
for his work has bounced.

00:07:29.490 --> 00:07:33.340
Moreover, the woman who offered Ray the job
is out of contact.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:37.570
They ask Lester to run a search but the man
dismisses them, claiming that Ray is doing

00:07:37.570 --> 00:07:38.630
his job.

00:07:38.630 --> 00:07:42.920
After the two leave, we see Lester calling
the prison warden and asking him to keep Ray

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:48.050
in the prison for the rest of his life.

00:07:48.050 --> 00:07:53.840
It turns out that Lester wants to have the
company to himself and be its sole owner.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:58.950
So, he had set up the fake deal to get Ray
to the prison and keep him there forever.

00:07:58.950 --> 00:08:03.169
However, Abigail and Hush do not give up and
keep looking for Ray.

00:08:03.169 --> 00:08:07.889
Hush finds out about an illegal private-owned
prison named the tomb that people put their

00:08:07.889 --> 00:08:08.889
enemies in.

00:08:08.889 --> 00:08:13.810
It is in fact, the prison that Ray is in but
Hush doesn’t find the prison’s location.

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:18.169
Back in the prison, Ray and Emil start to
analyze the guards’ routine which is difficult

00:08:18.169 --> 00:08:20.650
for them because the guards all wear identical
masks.

00:08:20.650 --> 00:08:25.470
They do it for several days and figure out
some important details about their schedule.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:29.340
Now, they have to figure out what part of
the world they are in so they can devise an

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:30.520
escape plan.

00:08:30.520 --> 00:08:35.380
For this, Ray tries to ask the prison doctor
for help but he refuses to do so.

00:08:35.380 --> 00:08:40.599
Hence, instead, he sneaks out a cardboard
paper to use it as a makeshift sextant and

00:08:40.599 --> 00:08:42.210
determine the ship’s latitude.

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:46.460
However, they will have to be on the top of
the deck to make the sextant work.

00:08:46.460 --> 00:08:52.490
So, Ray and Emil ask a Muslim inmate Javed
Afridi to help them with the plan.

00:08:52.490 --> 00:08:55.570
Later, Javed offers to be the warden’s spy.

00:08:55.570 --> 00:09:00.040
In turn, he asks the warden to let him pray
to Allah in the open air.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:04.420
Not knowing his true intentions, the warden
agrees and lets him go outside.

00:09:04.420 --> 00:09:08.870
Afridi then uses the sextant and figures out
the latitude of the ship.

00:09:08.870 --> 00:09:13.660
Using this information, Ray deduces that they
are in the Atlantic Ocean near Morocco.

00:09:13.660 --> 00:09:18.399
He and Emil are still not sure about the location
but they have to think of a plan soon.

00:09:18.399 --> 00:09:23.640
Emil says that he has a friend in Morocco
who owes him big time.

00:09:23.640 --> 00:09:28.110
If they somehow get a message to him, he and
his group will surely come to save them.

00:09:28.110 --> 00:09:32.339
Ray again meets the prison doctor and persuades
him to help them.

00:09:32.339 --> 00:09:40.040
Later at night, the doctor sends Emil’s
friend an email, giving him their location.

00:09:40.040 --> 00:09:42.190
It is finally the day they execute the plan.

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:48.040
At first, Afridi gives the warden fake information
about a riot about to happen in block A. The

00:09:48.040 --> 00:09:53.290
warden sends all his guards to the block leaving
the Babylon area with only two of them.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:57.160
Ray sees the right time and starts a riot
in the Babylon area.

00:09:57.160 --> 00:10:02.370
Soon, everyone starts fighting in the place
and Ray, Emil, and Afridi take the opportunity

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.149
to run to the top of the deck.

00:10:04.149 --> 00:10:08.060
The warden notices this and initiates a lockdown
in the cargo.

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:12.100
Before the three can reach the top, the doors
are shut because of the lockdown.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:16.760
At the same time, Emil’s men also arrive
in their helicopters to save them.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:20.899
But inside the ship, the guards and the group
get into a shootout.

00:10:20.899 --> 00:10:24.250
Afridi gets shot in the process and cannot
move anymore.

00:10:24.250 --> 00:10:30.260
Ray quickly thinks of a plan and asks Emil
to stay with Afridi while he goes to the control

00:10:30.260 --> 00:10:32.020
room and cuts the power.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:35.230
This way, the doors to the top of the deck
can reopen.

00:10:35.230 --> 00:10:40.910
After he leaves, Afridi asks Emil to leave
without him because he is too injured to make

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:41.910
it out alive.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:44.080
Emil reluctantly does what the man says.

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:47.190
Sometime later, the guards get to Afridi and
kill him.

00:10:47.190 --> 00:10:51.450
But at the same time, Ray manages to shut
the power down, helping Emil get on top of

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:52.450
the deck.

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:55.860
Emil runs to the helicopter which is being
shot by the guards.

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:59.960
Soon, he and his friends retaliate while waiting
for Ray to come out.

00:10:59.960 --> 00:11:03.209
Ray, however, is stuck inside the ship in
a tank.

00:11:03.209 --> 00:11:07.510
The guards are looking for him everywhere,
so instead of getting out, he flushes himself

00:11:07.510 --> 00:11:08.600
into the sea.

00:11:08.600 --> 00:11:12.480
Emil’s helicopter takes off and he sees
Ray struggling in the water.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.420
To help him, he throws the helicopter’s
ladder below.

00:11:15.420 --> 00:11:19.480
Ray latches onto the ladder and fires at the
oil tanks on the ship.

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:22.770
This causes an explosion that kills the warden
and his men.

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:28.279
At last, the two safely fly away in the helicopter
and land on the Moroccan coast.

00:11:28.279 --> 00:11:32.910
A car comes to pick them up and to Ray’s
surprise, Jessica, the woman who had offered

00:11:32.910 --> 00:11:35.459
him the job in the prison steps out of it.

00:11:35.459 --> 00:11:38.700
He is even more baffled when Emil says she
is his daughter.

00:11:38.700 --> 00:11:44.430
It is then revealed that Emil is actually
Mannheim, who everyone thought was his boss.

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:47.930
He had lied about his identity so his enemies
wouldn’t kill him.

00:11:47.930 --> 00:11:53.010
Jessica knew her father was in prison so she
had to get Ray imprisoned to get him out.

00:11:53.010 --> 00:11:57.330
Before leaving, Jessica tells Ray that his
business partner Lester got involved with

00:11:57.330 --> 00:12:02.830
the prison warden and demanded they keep Ray
forever, so he was in fact, betraying him.

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:06.230
In the following scene, we see Ray and Abigail
together.

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:11.430
Abigail informs him that Lester was offered
a job as CEO of the prison if the prototype

00:12:11.430 --> 00:12:14.380
Ray was staying in proved to be inescapable.

00:12:14.380 --> 00:12:18.010
After knowing that Ray has escaped, Lester
packs his bags to flee.

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:22.800
But Hush and Abigail track him down and put
Ray’s revenge plan into action.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:26.420
Then, we see Lester being attacked by Hush
in a car.

00:12:26.420 --> 00:12:31.040
When the man wakes up, he finds himself still
inside the car but his car turns out to be

00:12:31.040 --> 00:12:33.930
in a massive cargo ship traveling to an unknown
destination.

00:12:33.930 --> 00:12:35.379
Ray has taken his revenge in his own way.

